1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,855
You headbang at a concert,

2
00:00:01,855 --> 00:00:02,815
and now your ears

3
00:00:02,815 --> 00:00:04,400
are RINGING.

4
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:04,970
That ring

5
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:07,070
probably isn't your ears...

6
00:00:07,070 --> 00:00:08,400
it's your brain,

7
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,740
cranking its volume

8
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:11,633
to ELEVEN.

9
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:13,185
Loud music flattens

10
00:00:13,185 --> 00:00:14,248
the tiny hair cells

11
00:00:14,248 --> 00:00:15,300
in your ear,

12
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,233
so less sound gets through.

13
00:00:17,321 --> 00:00:19,000
And your brain goes...

14
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,072
who turned it DOWN?

15
00:00:21,072 --> 00:00:22,856
So it cranks the knob...

16
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:23,847
and hears its own

17
00:00:23,847 --> 00:00:24,950
static.

18
00:00:24,950 --> 00:00:26,233
That's the ring.

19
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:27,360
Don't believe me?

20
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:27,760
Put people

21
00:00:27,739 --> 00:00:28,864
with normal hearing

22
00:00:28,864 --> 00:00:29,915
in a dead-silent

23
00:00:29,915 --> 00:00:30,611
room,

24
00:00:30,611 --> 00:00:31,821
and most start hearing

25
00:00:31,821 --> 00:00:33,400
ringing and buzzing.

26
00:00:33,482 --> 00:00:34,267
It usually fades

27
00:00:34,267 --> 00:00:35,392
in a day or two.

28
00:00:35,392 --> 00:00:37,330
But hair cells that die

29
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:39,267
never grow back.

30
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:39,998
Chickens

31
00:00:39,998 --> 00:00:41,900
can regrow theirs.

32
00:00:42,018 --> 00:00:43,430
So next concert,

33
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:44,951
wear earplugs...

34
00:00:44,951 --> 00:00:46,514
or become a chicken.

